 his kingdom.", "words": [[0, 59367], [3, 59471], [8, 59651], [14, 60011], [17, 60231], [21, 60371], [26, 60631], [29, 60851], [33, 61151], [37, 61371], [44, 61751], [50, 62211], [54, 62751], [58, 62891], [67, 63311], [75, 63991], [78, 64211], [82, 64351]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 65346, "end": 70387, "text": "Your kingdom is an everlasting kingdom, and your dominion endures throughout all generations.", "words": [[0, 65346], [5, 65476], [13, 65776], [16, 66076], [19, 66196], [31, 66656], [40, 67376], [44, 67576], [49, 67716], [58, 68256], [66, 68756], [77, 69036], [81, 69376]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 70837, "end": 75204, "text": "The LORD upholds all that fall, and raises up all those that be bowed down.", "words": [[0, 70837], [4, 70924], [9, 71184], [17, 71864], [21, 72004], [26, 72204], [32, 72584], [36, 72864], [43, 73224], [46, 73484], [50, 73704], [56, 73984], [61, 74164], [64, 74304], [70, 74704]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 75654, "end": 79521, "text": "The eyes of all wait upon you; and you give them their food in due season.", "words": [[0, 75654], [4, 75783], [9, 76083], [12, 76283], [16, 76483], [21, 76723], [26, 76983], [31, 77668], [35, 77793], [39, 77893], [44, 78073], [49, 78253], [55, 78433], [60, 78673], [63, 78853], [67, 78973]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 79971, "end": 83610, "text": "You open your hand, and satisfy the desire of every living thing.", "words": [[0, 79971], [4, 80100], [9, 80380], [14, 80580], [20, 80880], [24, 81180], [32, 81660], [36, 81940], [43, 82320], [46, 82540], [52, 82800], [59, 83040]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 84060, "end": 88944, "text": "The LORD is righteous in all his ways, and holy in all his works.", "words": [[0, 84060], [4, 84211], [9, 84511], [12, 84771], [22, 85251], [25, 85631], [29, 85911], [33, 86171], [39, 87051], [43, 87131], [48, 87531], [51, 87871], [55, 88111], [59, 88351]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 89394, "end": 94818, "text": "The LORD is near to all them that call upon him, to all that call upon him in truth.", "words": [[0, 89394], [4, 89498], [9, 89798], [12, 90058], [17, 90358], [20, 90578], [24, 90898], [29, 91178], [34, 91458], [39, 91758], [44, 91998], [49, 92498], [52, 92718], [56, 92998], [61, 93218], [66, 93518], [71, 93818], [75, 94138], [78, 94358]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 95268, "end": 100805, "text": "He will fulfil the desire of them that fear him: he also will hear their cry, and will save them.", "words": [[0, 95268], [3, 95382], [8, 95622], [15, 95862], [19, 96102], [26, 96462], [29, 96722], [34, 96862], [39, 97082], [44, 97322], [49, 98073], [52, 98196], [57, 98496], [62, 98756], [67, 98956], [73, 99156], [78, 99556], [82, 99876], [87, 100056], [92, 100356]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 101255, "end": 105984, "text": "The LORD preserves all them that love him: but all the wicked will he destroy.", "words": [[0, 101255], [4, 101578], [9, 101798], [19, 102378], [23, 102658], [28, 102878], [33, 103118], [38, 103318], [43, 104075], [47, 104202], [51, 104362], [55, 104522], [62, 104742], [67, 105042], [70, 105242]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 106434, "end": 113150, "text": "My mouth shall speak the praise of the LORD: and let all flesh bless his holy name for ever and ever.", "words": [[0, 106434], [3, 106581], [9, 106901], [15, 107181], [21, 107461], [25, 107661], [32, 108001], [35, 108261], [39, 108361], [45, 109213], [49, 109341], [53, 109541], [57, 109741], [63, 110141], [69, 110521], [73, 110761], [78, 111021], [83, 111308], [87, 111594], [92, 111881], [96, 112201]]}]}